00:35:22.308 --> 00:35:47.164
And if you fast forward, I'm just talking about her own psychological journey when they're back in Barbieland and she realizes that Barbieland now has changed. Something completely different, completely foreign, and she even lost her house. She doubles down on this idea of, okay, I just want things to end.

00:35:47.293 --> 00:36:00.098
